WEBVTT

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.434
we'll revolt against this disorder.

00:14:02.458 --> 00:14:08.059
We will fight those nefarious forces
by building rich, engaging,

00:14:08.083 --> 00:14:10.768
inclusive and generous communities,

00:14:10.792 --> 00:14:12.393
and, in doing so,

00:14:12.417 --> 00:14:15.101
we will restore harmony to the land.

00:14:15.125 --> 00:14:18.750
(Applause)

00:14:22.625 --> 00:14:26.184
Now whether or not
you feel this is the right story,

00:14:26.208 --> 00:14:28.601
I hope you'll agree that we need one.

00:14:28.625 --> 00:14:30.976
We need a new restoration story,